WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.750
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.720
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:03.980
Welcome to another episode of

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.170
Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.190
This is the series

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.190
Where YOU

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.190
Challenge US

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.450
With your craziest ideas

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:10.450
Related to table tennis

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.059
