00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.240
This idea comes from Dry Ice Thug

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.080
We will spin around this stick

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.439
And try to make around the net shots

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.820
This is going to be horrible!

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.080
I know...

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.540
That's way too difficult!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.400
Henil Patel wants us to play a topspin rally

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.180
When only using our backhands.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:01.960
Let's do it.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:17.700
I don't feel good about this!

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.440
WOOOOW!!

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.200
C'mon!

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.400
That went well!

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.700
Emanuel Koscak wants us to play with a coffee
pot

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:44.820
Me and Otto both brought our favorite pots
with us

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.420
RandomDestroyerYT wants us to hit a ping pong
ball

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.300
Through the windows of a moving car

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.020
Let's do it!

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.360
Thank you!

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.220
Not good.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.460
Thanks for watching guys!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.320
If you enjoyed this episode

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.540
Make sure to leave it a thumbs up!

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.770
And if you want to support our channel even
more

